@alife-records 1

question VQ_BOOK_ABOUT
  q.tab house
  q.kind book
  q.vis hidden
  q.cost 0
  q.see asked:HOUSE_BOOK
  q.needs book
  q.pat whats it about|what's it about|what happens in it|tell me the story
  t.1 What's it about?
  t.2 What happens in it?
  t.3 Tell me the story
end

